cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software in your research, please cite it using the metadata from this file."
type: software
title: "IsoXRD: Lightweight Browser-Based XRD Phase Identification and Semi-Quantitative Carbonate Analysis Tool"
version: 3.2.0
date-released: 2026-11-13
authors:
  - family-names: "Yang"
    given-names: "Yun-Seok"
    affiliation: "IBS Center for Climate Physics, Pusan National University"
    # ORCID가 있으시면 아래 주석(#)을 지우고 번호를 입력해 주세요.
    # orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0000-0000-0000"
repository-code: "https://github.com/zinidsy-spec/IsoXRD"
url: "https://zinidsy-spec.github.io/IsoXRD/"
abstract: >-
  IsoXRD is a zero-installation, client-side web application for X-ray diffraction (XRD)
  mineral phase identification, non-linear sample displacement correction, multi-sample
  stack comparison, and integrated-area semi-quantitative carbonate (calcite vs. aragonite)
  estimation.
keywords:
  - "X-ray diffraction"
  - "XRD"
  - "mineral phase identification"
  - "carbonate"
  - "speleothem"
  - "calcite"
  - "aragonite"
  - "open-source scientific software"
license: MIT
